        <mxCell id="SoWYy6XlDDOlxKxWgFf8-33" value="Minimum information (could always have more) in each communication (not including authentication key which is in every communication):&#xa;- 1: name of algorithm, publisher name &#xa;- 2: approval or rejection of registration&#xa;- 3: Initial Configuration, desired end state&#xa;- 4,5: The set of moves that have been made during each tick. The tick rate will probably be around 1 second&#xa;- 6: Nothing extra other than the assertion that it is finished" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
